<title>GERMANY: SOCCER-HOBSCH SET TO MOVE FROM BREMEN TO RENNES.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-HOBSCH SET TO MOVE FROM BREMEN TO RENNES.</headline>
<dateline>BREMEN, Germany 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Werder Bremen striker Bernd Hobsch is expected to sign for French first division Rennes this week, Germany's SID sports news agency reported on Tuesday.</p>
</text>
